    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like im just hitting a wall with this new album. everything i write feels so empty and fake. like i'm just pretending to have feelings when really there's nothing left inside. just this heavy, gray nothingness. it's hard to even want to finish it when everything feels so pointless.",
